          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“K'ekihongokye araletaga omwana gw'entama aha rw'ekihongo ky'enyatano y'obufu, aletega omuagazi enzira kamogo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akiteho omukonogwe aha mutwe mbali baitira ekihongo ky'okwokibwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho omukuhani aihisehoga orukumurwe obwamba abuteke aha mahembe ga alutare y'ekihongo ky'okwokibwa, obwamba bwakyo obusigaire abusheshe aha maguru ga alutare. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.4.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.4.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 4:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ebishaju byayo byona abihyeho nk'okwo ebishaju by'omwana gw'entama biihwa aha kitambo ky'ebihongo by'emilembe. Omukuhani abyokeze ahali alutare, eiguru y'ebihongo by'Omukama ebyokesibwe omuliro. Omukuhani amugilirega enyatano aha rw'obufu obwo arabaga akozire, aragarulirwaga.”",
          "type": "text",
